message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. 若使用本作，请按下述格式引用。"
type: book
title: "错位的时间：为什么我们总是来不及——社会系统的时间错配与可控性边界 / Desynchronized Time: Why We Are Always Too Late — Temporal Mismatch and the Boundary of Controllability in Social Systems"
abstract: >-
  本书放弃“预测崩溃”，转而诊断“系统是否来得及自救”。它在三根不可逆轴
  （Θ 租佃份额、I 组织复杂度、κ 地缘耦合）之外，提出一个独立的时间来源：
  时间错配 τ = T_min / T_available 与可控性 C = T_policy / T_threat = 1/τ。
  全书五部分、十九章、附录 A—J；不预测崩溃时点，只做受限的局部诊断，
  并提供可证伪的命题登记簿与开放的数据缺口清单。
  English: This monograph abandons "predicting collapse" and asks a more
  actionable question — can a system still save itself in time? Beyond the
  three irreversible axes Θ (rent/monopoly extraction share), I (coordination
  time) and κ (geopolitical coupling), it introduces an independent temporal
  source: temporal mismatch τ = T_min / T_available and controllability
  C = T_policy / T_threat = 1/τ. Five parts, nineteen chapters, appendices A–J.
